2.
Definitions.
(1)
In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires, -
(a)
"authorised officer" means an officers not below the rank of a Deputy Director authorised by Director for the purpose of
these rules;
(b)
"Director" means the Director appointed under clause (e) of sub-section (1) of section 2 of the Ordinance;
(c)
"Form" means forms appended to these rules;
(d)
"material means the material in possession of Director or the authorised officer, after search or seizure under subsection
(1) of section 8 the Ordinance;
(e)
"Ordinance" means the Fugitive Economic Offenders Ordinance, 2018 (1 of 2018);
(f)
"place" means a place, related to the fugitive economic offender;
(g)
"records" include the records maintained in the form of books or stored in a computer or tapes or discs or in any other
electronic form or transcribed information;
(h)
"Schedule" means the Schedule to the Ordinance;
(i)
"section" means a section of the Ordinance;
(2)
All other words and expressions used and not defined in these rules but defined in the Ordinance shall have the
meaning respectively assigned to them in the Ordinance.
